# tof_recover_frozen_ground.scn — ToF goes silent BEFORE takeoff and returns while the craft is far above its range
#                                 離陸の「前」に ToF が出力停止し、機体がレンジのはるか上にいる間に復帰する
#
# STABILIZE, ARM at 4.0 s, the ToF stops at
# 5.0 s (on the ground: the ground-contact flag freezes at "ground"), the pilot climbs blind to ~1.8 m (above the
# ~1.6 m range), the ToF resumes at 8.6 s but its first samples are out of range (invalid). Before the fix the
# frozen "ground" flag was trusted again, the estimator pinned position/velocity to 0 while the craft climbed to
# 10 m under ALT_HOLD, and the auto-landing completed at altitude (motors off at 10 m). Spec under test:
#  1. The silence flips the raw ground flag to "airborne" and the silence EPISODE lasts until the estimator has
#     re-acquired the ToF (not until a sample arrives): log "estimator has not re-acquired the ToF yet".
#  2. The estimator re-acquires the ToF (vertical covariance inflated, innovation gate lifted for one sample, the
#     same mechanism as the end of a flip): log "ToF re-acquired", innovation 1.5 m.
#  3. The craft never climbs away (truth alt_max 2.5 m, was 10.9 m) and no landing is declared at altitude.
#  4. The pilot's later crash (throttle stick to the bottom in STABILIZE, 10.3 s) is the pilot's, and the next
#     flight (ARM in ALT_HOLD at 17 s) is normal: auto-takeoff to 0.8 m, estimate within 0.1 m of the truth.
#
# STABILIZE、4.0 s に ARM、5.0 s に ToF が
# 出力停止（地上で。接地フラグは「接地」のまま固定）、パイロットがレンジ（約 1.6 m）を超える約 1.8 m まで ToF
# なしで上昇、8.6 s に ToF が復帰するが最初のサンプルは範囲外（無効）。main（2026-11-08 時点）は固定されたままの「接地」フラグが再び信用され、
# 推定器は機体が上昇する間ずっと位置・速度を 0 に固定し、ALT_HOLD で 10 m まで上昇して、自動着陸が高所で完了した
# （10 m でモータ停止）。検証する仕様: (1) 出力停止が生の接地フラグを「空中」に倒し、エピソードはサンプルが届いた
# ときでなく推定器が ToF を取り込み直すまで続く、(2) 推定器が ToF を取り込み直す（鉛直共分散を広げ、1 サンプルだけ
# イノベーション判定を外す。宙返りの終わりと同じ仕組み。イノベーション 1.5 m）、(3) 機体は上昇し続けず（真値の
# alt_max 2.5 m）、高所で着陸は宣言されない、(4) その後のパイロットの墜落（STABILIZE でスロットルを
# 最下端、10.3 s）はパイロットのもので、次の飛行（17 s に ALT_HOLD で ARM）は正常: 0.8 m への自動離陸、推定は真値の
# 0.1 m 以内。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/tof_recover_frozen_ground.scn --target vehicle --duration 24000000
#
#  <t>      ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                 # A: boot at rest, calibration
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50                 # B: ARM (4.0 s), STABILIZE
   +    tof_silent 1                                                             # C: 5.0 s — ToF output stops (on the ground)
   +    rc         3171  2048   2048    2048  1     2600      50                 # D: blind climb (5.0-7.6 s)
   +    rc         3050  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50                 # E: near-hover throttle (to 8.6 s), ~1.8 m
   +    tof_silent 0                                                             # F: 8.6 s — samples return (out of range at first)
   +    rc         3050  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50                 # G: samples are invalid above the range (to 9.6 s)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     6000      50        1        # H: ALT switch ON (refused in flight), pilot drops the stick -> crash 10.3 s
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50        1        # I: release the ARM button (15.6 s)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     6000      50        1        # J: ARM in ALT_HOLD (16.1 s) -> auto-takeoff, estimate agrees with the truth
